645bdcb1f361b","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["huangli-q-43a5e313e1c23bb63d00","huangli-q2-6254044d8d3612c9cdf7"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-2022f055caa636899ad0","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-fe752448b5205d5377fb","layer":"original","quote":"凯与府丞蜀郡王伉，帅厉吏民，闭境拒闿","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-43a5e313e1c23bb63d00","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-4fa98566de987fcf2019","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-fe752448b5205d5377fb","layer":"original","quote":"闿数移檄永昌，称说云云","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-799c2a268e514c1dcd6f","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-d5b6b0e65380c6f0e3c3","layer":"original","quote":"以凯为云南太守，封阳迁亭侯","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-a26e1b325e226f8b0462","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-49be78af6ec4af5079d0","layer":"original","quote":"凯答檄曰：“天降丧乱〖4〗，奸雄乘衅〖5〗；天下切齿，万国悲悼；臣妾大小，莫不思竭筋力；肝脑涂地，以除国难。伏惟将军世受汉恩，以为当躬聚党众，率先启行；上以报国家，下不负先人；书功竹帛，遗名千载。何期臣仆吴越〖6〗，背本就末乎！昔舜勤民事，陨于苍梧〖7〗；书籍嘉之，流声无穷〖8〗。崩于江浦〖9〗，何足可悲！文、武受命〖10〗，成王乃平〖11〗。先帝龙兴，海内望风；宰臣聪睿，自天降康。而将军不睹盛衰之纪〖12〗，成败之符〖13〗；譬如野火在原，蹈履河冰；火灭冰泮〖14〗，将何所依附？曩者将军先君雍侯〖15〗，造怨而封；窦融知兴〖16〗，归志世祖〖17〗：皆流名后叶，世歌其美。今诸葛丞相英才挺出，深睹未萌〖18〗；受遗托孤，翊赞季兴〖19〗；与众无忌，录功忘瑕〖20〗。将军若能翻然改图，易迹更步；古人不难追，鄙土何足宰哉〖21〗？盖闻楚国不恭〖22〗，齐桓是责；夫差僭号〖23〗，晋人不长〖24〗；况臣于非主，谁肯归之邪？窃惟古义，臣无越境之交，是以前后有来无往。重承告示〖25〗，发愤忘食；故略陈所怀，惟将军察焉","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":460,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-a550772c116de89e9c5f","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-d5b6b0e65380c6f0e3c3","layer":"original","quote":"会为叛夷所害","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-d95e54a84d59bea5fadd","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-d5b6b0e65380c6f0e3c3","layer":"original","quote":"子祥嗣","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q2-6254044d8d3612c9cdf7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"凯威恩内著，为郡中所信，故能全其节。及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道，而闿已为高定部曲所杀。亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔！”","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"huangli-p0004":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
